  "statements": [
    {
      "type": "General: Product/Version Code",
      "notes": "Rev. 01-001-CPS001 03/13"
    },
    {
      "type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)",
      "notes": "{chart}\nThese POWERFUL Stacks when used together are designed to help promote the ultimate Anabolic physique.\nWORKOUT DAYS\nSTACKING PROTOCOL PRE-WORKOUT POST-WORKOUT NON-WORKOUT DAYS MORNING AFTERNOON\nBETA-ALKALINE(TM) {scoop} x 1 30 - 45 MIN PRIOR {image} x 1\nCREATINE-ALKALINE(TM) {image} x2 IMMEDIATELY AFTER {image} x 2\nGLUTA-ALKALINE(TM) (image} x 1 1 - 2 HOURS PRIOR {image} x 1\nLEUCINE AGMA pH(TM) {image} x 1 {image} x 1\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Creatine Monohydrate and Creatine HCI: Creatine Monohydrate is the most heavily researched and trusted form of creatine, backed by hundreds of studies. So how can you make something great even better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)",
      "notes": "The minds behind BPI Sports have tackled this scientific dilemma head-on with the development of pH-Alkaline(TM), a unique pH Bu\u001eering Technology."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "It’s known that once creatine monohydrate hits the stomach it can become unstable and can break down into creatinine, a potentially dangerous byproduct. It’s believed that this unwanted breakdown is accelerated through lower pH levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)",
      "notes": "pH-Alkaline(TM) is designed to work by helping balance pH levels at closer to neutral alkalinity, which can in turn stop the unwanted conversion to creatinine, and enhance overall creatine absorption."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "The scientists at BPI didn’t stop there though. Creatine monohydrate may be King, but there’s a new ‘800 pound gorilla’ in the room and it’s called Creatine HCI. Many are saying that it’s an unbelievable achievement of Muscle Building Architecture. The combination of\nthese two muscle building powerhouses makes for an unrivaled formula and unmatched results."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "References select isolated constituent parts, as it relates to analytical characterization of the same.\nWhen combined with a proper exercise and nutrition regimen. Statements based on early-stage independent 3rd party in vivo and / or in vitro model scientific research data findings."
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "THESE STATEMENTS HAVE NOT BEEN EVALUATED BY THE FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION. DIETARY SUPPLEMENT 60 SERVINGS THIS PRODUCT IS NOT INTENDED TO DIAGNOSE, TREAT, CURE, OR PREVENT ANY DISEASE."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "POWERSERIES"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "pH SORB(TM)\nBUFFERING TECHNOLOGY PATENT PENDING"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "bpi"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "CLINICAL POWERSERIES"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "pH BUFFERED CREATINE MUSCLE SYNTHESIS\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "PRO LEVEL CREATINE MONOHYDRATE & CREATINE HCL"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "MAY EXPERIENCE:\nINCREASED MUSCLE\nINCREASED STRENGTH\nINCREASED SIZE"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "LABORATORY CERTIFIED\nIndependent Third-Party"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Statement of Identity",
      "notes": "DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Please read entire label before use."
    },
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Suggested Use: Take 1 serving (2 capsules) with 12 ounces of water once daily on an empty stomach or with a meal, or as directed by a qualified healthcare practitioner."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Children",
      "notes": "Warnings: Not intended for use by persons under age 18."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Do not exceed recommended dose."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications",
      "notes": "Get the consent of a licensed physician before using this product, especially if you are taking\nmedication, have a medical condition, you are pregnant, nursing or thinking about becoming pregnant."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Children",
      "notes": "KEEP THIS PRODUCT AND ALL SUPPLEMENTS OUT OF THE REACH OF CHILDREN."
    }
